cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use beets-pysacd, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: beets-pysacd
abstract: >-
  beets-pysacd is a beets plugin that imports SACD images (.iso), which beets
  can't tag on its own: it reads each disc with pysacd, finds the MusicBrainz
  release and the SACD layer the disc is, and imports each area as DSF or FLAC
  through beets' normal importer, so stereo and multichannel layers stay apart
  in the library.
authors:
  - alias: aclater
    website: "https://github.com/aclater"
version: 0.2.2
date-released: "2026-11-15"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dsd-toolbox/beets-pysacd"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/beets-pysacd/"
license: GPL-2.0-or-later
keywords:
  - beets
  - SACD
  - DSD
  - DSF
  - FLAC
  - MusicBrainz
  - music library
  - audio
